message: "If you use this code or the underlying frequency data, please cite the accompanying manuscript as below."
type: software
title: "The Climate-Resilience Ledger: Reinterpreting the Indus Script as an Ecological Survival Technology"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sharma"
    given-names: "Harshit"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
