    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22649425"
url: "https://github.com/stormbreaker-mcu/indus-climate-ledger"
repository-code: "https://github.com/stormbreaker-mcu/indus-climate-ledger"
abstract: >
  This repository contains the Python analysis pipeline, SQL queries, and 
  frequency tables used to test the 'Climate-Resilience Ledger' hypothesis 
  of the undeciphered Indus script. The code analyzes the distribution of 
  the 'Jar + Numeral' grapheme pattern across the Interactive Corpus of 
  Indus Texts (ICIT) to test for urban administrative concentration during 
  the 4.2 ka aridification event.
keywords:
  - "Indus script"
  - "paleoclimatology"
  - "archaeology"
  - "epigraphy"
  - "4.2 ka event"
  - "ICIT"
  - "computational archaeology"
